id=gxr-display-off
name=Galaxy XR display-off on eye loss
version=v0.2.0
versionCode=2
author=compdoge
description=Blanks both Galaxy XR panels (or triggers sleep) after the wearer's eyes are gone for the set delay, and restores them the moment eyes return. Suppresses the stock SystemUI eye-sleep while enabled. Installs disabled; enable it in the Manager.
